description:
Design a 4-bit up/down counter that increments or decrements its value based on the input signal `UD`. The counter counts upwards when `UD` is low, wrapping from 15 (4'b1111) back to 0 (4'b0000), and counts downwards when `UD` is high, wrapping from 0 back to 15. The counter's operation is synchronized to the rising edge of the clock signal `CLK`, ensuring reliable performance in synchronous digital systems.
module top_module(
    input CLK,
    input UD,
    output reg [3:0] Q
);

