description:
Implement a transport delay module that introduces a specified propagation delay to an input signal. The module takes a one-bit wide input and produces an output that reflects the input after a fixed delay of 10 picoseconds. This design effectively simulates delayed signal behavior, useful in timing analysis and synchronization applications in digital circuits.
module top_module(
    s_in,
    s_out
);

